**POST /api/v1/memos**

Defined by the `google.api.http` annotation on the `CreateMemo` RPC in `proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto:21-25`:

```proto
rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/memos"
    body: "memo"
  };
  option (google.api.method_signature) = "memo";
}
```

